[0.011835, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[11A\u001b[38;5;114m⏺\r\u001b[5C\u001b[2B\u001b[39mdiff --git\u001b[17Ga/docs/intent/trial/trial-design.md\u001b[53Gb/docs/intent/trial/trial-design.md\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bindex\u001b[12Ge06290b..f4a1e7b\u001b[29G100644\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   --- a/docs/intent/trial/trial-design.md\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m… +21 lines (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  \u001b[39mUpdated\u001b[14G\u001b[1mdocs/intent/trial/trial-design.md\u001b[48G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;246m(+4 -2)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 14 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 15 \u001b[22m ## When the trial ends\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 16 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 17 -\u001b[38;5;231mThe trial ends 720 hours after signup.                                             \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 17 +\u001b[38;5;231mThe trial ends at midnight in the user's own time zone: the first local midnight at\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231m or after 30 days from signup. A user who signs up in Tokyo at 11 p.m. on March 1 k\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231meeps the "]
[8.2e-05, "o", "trial until 00:00 on April 1, Tokyo time, and so does one who signs up the\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mre at 9 a.m. the same day.                                                         \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 18 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                   \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 19 +\u001b[38;5;231mEvery user therefore gets at least 30 full days, and at most one day more. The end \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mis a calendar date in the user's own zone, so it can be told to them plainly (\"your\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231m trial ends at midnight, March 31\").                                               \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 20\u001b[10G\u001b[22m \u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 21\u001b[10G\u001b[22m ##\u001b[14GDecisions\u001b[24G&\u001b[26GAlternatives\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 22\u001b[10G\u001b[22m \u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 23\u001b[10G\u001b[22m |\u001b[13GDecision\u001b[22G|\u001b[24GChosen\u001b[31G|\u001b[33GAlternatives\u001b[46GCon"]
[8.2e-05, "o", "sidered\u001b[57G|\u001b[59GRationale\u001b[69G|\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 24\u001b[10G\u001b[22m |---|---|---|---|\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 23 -\u001b[38;5;231m| Trial length | 720 hours from signup | Midnight on day 30 in the server's time zo\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231mne | Counting hours gives every user the full 30 days wherever they live. Ending at\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231m the server's midnight would cut a Tokyo signup's trial 14 hours short, and the HLD\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231m's tenet leans toward the customer. |                                              \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 25 +\u001b[38;5;231m| When the trial ends | The first midnight in the user's time zone at or after 30 d\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mays from signup | 720 hours after signup; midnight ending the 30th day in the user'\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231ms time zone, counting the signup day as day 1; midnight in the se"]
[0.000163, "o", "rver's time zone |\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231m A local midnight gives the user a clear end date in their own day. Rounding up to \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mthe next midnight keeps the full 30 days for everyone, at the cost of up to one ext\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mra day, which the HLD's tenet accepts. Counting the signup day as day 1 would cut a\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231m late-evening signup's trial nearly a day short. 720 hours ends at an arbitrary loc\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mal time of day. The server's midnight would cut trials short by up to a day dependi\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mng on where the user lives. |                                                      \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G⎿\u001b[5G (files\u001b[13Gthat\u001b[18Gchanged\u001b[26Gwhile\u001b[32Gthis\u001b[37Gcommand\u001b[45Gran,\u001b[50Gby\u001b[53Gthe\u001b[57Gcommand\u001b[65Gor\u001b[68Gby\u001b[71Ganother\u001b[79Gprocess;\u001b[88Ga\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b"]
