[0.026446, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[2C\u001b[5A────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[1m#:\u001b[22m 4\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[1mGap:\u001b[8GThe stored time zone is missing or not a valid IANA name.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m  \u001b[1mMy recommendation:\u001b[22m Use the zone whose midnight comes \u001b[1mlatest\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;5;153mEtc/GMT+12\u001b[39m, which is UTC−12), so\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  nobody's trial is cut short. Plain UTC is simpler.\u001b[K\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
