[0.000908, "o", "231meeps the trial until 00:00 on April 1, Tokyo time, and so does one who signs up the\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231mre at 9 a.m. the same day.                                                         \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 19 +\u001b[38;5;231mThe trial ends at the start of the first local calendar day, in the user's time zon\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231me, that begins at or after 720 hours from signup. The trial has ended once the curr\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231ment time is at or after that instant.                                              \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 20\u001b[10G\u001b[22m \u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 19 -\u001b[38;5;231mEvery user therefore gets at least 30 full days, and at most one day more. The end \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231mis a calendar date in the user's own zone, so it can be told to them plainly (\"your\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231m trial runs through Mar"]
