[0.017679, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[7A\u001b[38;5;246m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(docs/intent/trial/trial-specs.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m✶\u001b[3GUnraveling… \u001b[38;5;246m(12s · ↓\u001b[24G1.1k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Double-tap esc to rewind the code and/or conversation to a previous point in time\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;220m⏵⏵\u001b[6Gauto\u001b[11Gmode\u001b[16Gon\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab\u001b[30Gto\u001b[33Gcycle)\u001b[40G·\u001b[42Gesc\u001b[46Gto\u001b[49Ginterrupt\u001b[59G·\u001b[61G←\u001b[63G1\u001b[65Gagent\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.004927, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[9A\u001b[38;5;114m⏺\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m6\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines,\u001b[21Gremoved\u001b[29G\u001b[1m2\u001b[31G\u001b[22mlines\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m  8 \u001b[22m Status markers: `[x]` implemented · `[ ]` active gap · `[D]` deferred\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m - `[x]` **TRIAL-001**: When a new user signs up, the system shall start a trial.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 11 -\u001b[38;5;231m- `[x]` **TRIAL-002**: While a trial is active, the system shall give the user full\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231m access.                                                                           \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m     \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 12 -\u001b[38;5;231m- `[x]` **TRIAL-003**: When 720 hours have passed since signup, the system shall en\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231md the trial.                                                                       \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 11 +\u001b[38;5;23"]
[0.00029, "o", "1m- `[\u001b[48;5;28m \u001b[48;5;22m]` **TRIAL-002**: While \u001b[48;5;28mthe\u001b[48;5;22m \u001b[48;5;28mcurrent\u001b[48;5;22m \u001b[48;5;28mtime \u001b[48;5;22mis \u001b[48;5;28mbefore the trial's stored end time\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231m, the system shall give the user full access.                                      \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 12 +\u001b[38;5;231m- `[ ]` **TRIAL-003**: When the current time reaches or passes the trial's stored e\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mnd time, the system shall end the trial.                                           \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 13 +\u001b[38;5;231m- `[ ]` **TRIAL-004**: When a trial starts, the system shall set the trial's end ti\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mme to the start of the first calendar day, in the user's recorded time zone, that b\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231megins at or after 720 elapsed hours from signup.                                   \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5"]
