[8.1e-05, "o", " the trial's stored e\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231mnd time, the system shall end the trial.                                           \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 13 -\u001b[38;5;231m- `[ ]` **TRIAL-004**: When a trial starts, the system shall set the trial's end ti\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231mme to the start of the first calendar day, in the user's recorded time zone, that b\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231megins at or after 720 elapsed hours from signup.                                   \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 14 -\u001b[38;5;231m- `[ ]` **TRIAL-005**: When a trial starts, the system shall store the trial's end \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231mtime on the trial.                                                                 \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 15 -\u001b[38;5;231m- `[ ]` **TRIAL-006**: If the user's time zone changes after a trial has started, t\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b"]
[8.1e-05, "o", "[38;5;231mhe system shall keep the trial's stored end time unchanged.                        \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 16 -\u001b[38;5;231m- `[ ]` **TRIAL-007**: If the user's recorded time zone is missing or is not a vali\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231md IANA time zone name, then the system shall compute the trial's end time in `Etc/G\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231mMT+12`.                                                                            \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 11 +\u001b[38;5;231m- `[\u001b[48;5;28mx\u001b[48;5;22m]` **TRIAL-002**: While the current time is before the trial's stored end time\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231m, the system shall give the user full access.                                      \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 12 +\u001b[38;5;231m- `[\u001b[48;5;28mx\u001b[48;5;22m]` **TRIAL-003**: When the current time reaches or passes the trial's stored e\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mnd time, the system"]
[0.000163, "o", " shall end the trial.                                           \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 13 +\u001b[38;5;231m- `[\u001b[48;5;28mx\u001b[48;5;22m]` **TRIAL-004**: When a trial starts, the system shall set the trial's end ti\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mme to the start of the first calendar day, in the user's recorded time zone, that b\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231megins at or after 720 elapsed hours from signup.                                   \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 14 +\u001b[38;5;231m- `[\u001b[48;5;28mx\u001b[48;5;22m]` **TRIAL-005**: When a trial starts, the system shall store the trial's end \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mtime on the trial.                                                                 \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 15 +\u001b[38;5;231m- `[\u001b[48;5;28mx\u001b[48;5;22m]` **TRIAL-006**: If the user's time zone changes after a trial has started, t\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mhe system shall keep the trial'"]
[8.1e-05, "o", "s stored end time unchanged.                        \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 16 +\u001b[38;5;231m- `[\u001b[48;5;28mx\u001b[48;5;22m]` **TRIAL-007**: If the user's recorded time zone is missing or is not a vali\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231md IANA time zone name, then the system shall compute the trial's end time in `Etc/G\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mMT+12`.                                                                            \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G⎿\u001b[5G Allowed\u001b[14Gby\u001b[17Gauto\u001b[22Gmode\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;174m✽\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;180mForging…\u001b[38;5;174m \u001b[38;5;246m(1m\u001b[16G5s\u001b[19G·\u001b[21G↓\u001b[23G7.2k\u001b[28Gtokens)\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G⎿\u001b[5G Tip:\u001b[11GPress\u001b[17Gshift+↑\u001b[25Gor\u001b[28Gshift+↓\u001b[36Gat\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gprompt\u001b[50Gto\u001b[53Graise\u001b[59Gor\u001b[62Glower\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Geffort\u001b[79Glevel\u001b[85Gfor\u001b[89Gthis\u001b[94Gsession\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────"]
